{"availability":"available","full":"opendilab/LightRFT","name":"LightRFT","description":"LightRFT: Light, Efficient, Omni-modal & Reward-model Driven Reinforcement Fine-Tuning Framework","category":"Education","language":"Python","stars":399,"forks":12,"created":"2025-12-23T03:58:37Z","updated":"2026-09-07T09:24:55Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://opendilab.github.io/LightRFT","topics":["dapo","grpo","llm","llm-training","multi-modal","reinforcement-learning","reward-model","rft","vlm"],"demo":"https://opendilab.github.io/LightRFT","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T09:02:08.733Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T09:02:08.733Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T09:02:08.733Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T09:02:08.733Z","stars":399,"forks":12}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Light, Efficient, Omni-modal & Reward-model Driven Reinforcement Fine-Tuning Framework","LightRFT (Light Reinforcement Fine-Tuning) is a reinforcement fine-tuning framework for large language models (LLMs) and vision-language or multimodal generative models (VLMs). It provides a structured and extensible workflow for reinforcement learning with verifiable rewards (RLVR), reinforcement learning from human feedback (RLHF), and model-reward-driven policy optimization, covering policy sampling, reward computation, advantage estimation, and policy updates. The repository also includes reward-model training and on-policy distillation workflows.","LightRFT uses torchrun and PyTorch distributed communication as its runtime foundation. A unified Strategy interface connects FSDP v2 and DeepSpeed ZeRO training backends with SGLang and vLLM rollout backends. Current code paths and examples include text, image, video, and audio tasks. “Omni-modal” means that the repository contains dedicated model, data, or example paths for these modalities; it does not imply that every model and modality combination works without adaptation."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/opendilab/LightRFT/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"192ef8da816b2c953302728d3d9317ec17a7f02d61f993292e4cab790db48020","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T09:02:08.782Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T09:02:08.782Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Light, Efficient, Omni-modal & Reward-model Driven Reinforcement Fine-Tuning Framework","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/opendilab/LightRFT/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"192ef8da816b2c953302728d3d9317ec17a7f02d61f993292e4cab790db48020","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/opendilab/LightRFT/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T09:02:08.782Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-07T09:24:55Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/opendilab/LightRFT/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T09:02:08.783Z","hash":"192ef8da816b2c953302728d3d9317ec17a7f02d61f993292e4cab790db48020","originalBytes":21415,"storedBytes":21415,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["source","training","docs","examples","gsm8k","reward","lightrft","bash","geo3k","policy","advantage","model","vllm","best","practice","repository","optimization","sglang","installation","pytorch","rollout","strategy","data","documentation","fsdp","grpo","path","runtime","start","supported","text","deepspeed","paths","quick","arxiv","distillation","distributed","engine","estimation","guide","image","install","models","sampling","audio","gpu","run","uses","backend","checkpoints","configuration","docker","example","flashattention","license","local","make","pip","python","reinforcement","see","sequence","version","vision","algorithm","architecture","baseline","build","current","default","entry","evaluation","launcher","optional","requires","rewards","roadmap","teacher","troubleshooting","utils","video","weight","analysis","b.sh","contributing","cuda","dataset","design","dockerfile","estimator","fine-tuning","grm","group","opend